title: "Enrichment Waterfall Benchmark"
abstract: "Open benchmark of B2B contact enrichment APIs: does a multi-provider waterfall find more verified work emails and working mobiles than a single-provider database? Same 500 contacts, one verifier, ranked by cost per 1,000 verified emails."
